libxcorr
------------------------------------------
Library that provides a Cross Correlation function for C based on FFTW3.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libfftw3-devel-3.3.11-1
  libfftw3_3-3.3.11-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libxcorr-devel-0+git20170630-1bl1
  libxcorr0-0+git20170630-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libfftw3-devel-3.3.11-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/dMaggot/libxcorr

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/dMaggot/libxcorr.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libxcorr-0+git20170630-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libxcorr-0+git20170630-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libxcorr-0+git20170630-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libxcorr-0+git20170630-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libxcorr0-0+git20170630-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libxcorr-devel-0+git20170630-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libxcorr)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libxcorr.README
  /usr/share/doc/libxcorr/README

(libxcorr0)
  /usr/bin/cygxcorr-0.dll

(libxcorr-devel)
  /usr/include/xcorr.h
  /usr/lib/libxcorr.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libxcorr.pc

